ng qua gi\'e1 x\'e3ng d\u7847\'3fu; B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn nh\'fd sau:
