\b\f0\fs28\expnd4\expndtw24\lang1033\langfe1033\langnp1033\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 I- PH\u7840\'3fM VI \'c1P D\u7908\'3fNG}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\ul\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\sl-320\slmult0\widctlpar\tx1251\tx1971\tx2691\tx3411\tx4131\tx4851\tx5571\tx6291\tx7011\tx7731\tx8451\tx9171\tx9891\tx10611\tx11331\wrapdefault\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11470569 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 1. \'d0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng ch\u7883\'3fu l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng qua gi\'e1 x\'e3ng d\u7847\'3fu:
\par Theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 1 Ngh\u7883\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 186/CP ng\'e0y 7/12/1994 c\u7911\'3fa Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 , th
\'ec c\'e1}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 c lo\u7841\'3fi x\'e3ng d\u7847\'3fu, d\u7847\'3fu di\'eazen c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc nh\u7853\'3fp kh\u7849\'3fu, s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845
\'3ft, ch\u7871\'3f bi\u7871\'3fn x\'e3ng, d\u7847\'3fu xu\u7845\'3ft b\'e1n ra cho c\'e1c t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc, c\'e1 nh\'e2n kh\'e1c, \'f0\u7873\'3fu ph\u7843\'3fi ch\u7883\'3fu ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng t\'ednh v\'e0o gi\'e1 b\'e1n.
\par 2. C\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi x\'e3ng, d\u7847\'3fu sau \'f0\'e2y kh\'f4ng ph\u7843\'3fi ch\u7883\'3fu l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng :
\par - X\'e3ng , d\u7847\'3fu di\'eazen xu\u7845\'3ft kh\u7849\'3fu, k\u7875\'3f c\u7843\'3f tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp t\u7841\'3fm nh\u7853\'3fp t\'e1i xu\u7845\'3ft, nh\u7853\'3fp xu\u7845\'3ft kh\u7849\'3fu qu\'e1 c\u7843\'3fnh.
\par - X\'e3ng m\'e1y bay, x\'e3ng c\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp, d\u7847\'3fu maz\'fat, d\u7847\'3fu l\u7917\'3fa. Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi x\'e3ng m\'e1y bay, x\'e3ng c\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp, d\u7847\'3fu maz
\'fat, d\u7847\'3fu l\u7917\'3fa d\'fd\u7899\'3fi b\u7845\'3ft k\u7923\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061  h\'ecnh th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 \u7913\'3fc n\'e0o cho ph\'fd\'f5ng ti\u7879\'3fn giao th\'f4ng \'f0\'fd\u7901\'3fng b\u7897\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061  th\'ec v}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 \u7851\'3fn ph\u7843\'3fi ch\u7883\'3fu l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 1 Ngh\u7883\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889
\'3f 186./CP v\'e0 h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn t\u7841\'3fi Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y.
\par 3. \'d0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng thu v\'e0 n\u7897\'3fp l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng qua gi\'e1 x\'e3ng d\u7847\'3fu:
\par \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 3 Ngh\u7883\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 186/CP ng\'e0y 7/12/1994 c\u7911\'3fa Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh : "T\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\'e9p nh\u7853\'3fp kh\u7849\'3fu, ch\u7871\'3f bi\u7871\'3f
n x\'e3ng, d\u7847\'3fu c\'f3 nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f thu v\'e0 n\u7897\'3fp l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng v\'e0o Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc khi b\'e1n x\'e3ng, d\u7847\'3fu" bao g\u7891\'3fm:
\par - T\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp nh\u7853\'3fp kh\u7849\'3fu x\'e3ng, d\u7847\'3fu di\'eazen xu\u7845\'3ft, b\'e1n ra;
\par - T\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc nh\u7853\'3fn u\u7927\'3f th\'e1c nh\u7853\'3fp kh\u7849\'3fu x\'e3ng, d\u7847\'3fu di\'eazen xu\u7845\'3ft giao cho t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc \'f0i u\u7927\'3f th\'e1c;
\par - T\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc nh\u7853\'3fn u\u7927\'3f th\'e1c nh\u7853\'3fp kh\u7849\'3fu \'f0\u7891\'3fng th\u7901\'3fi nh\u7853\'3fn u\u7927\'3f th\'e1c b\'e1n x\'e3ng, d\u7847\'3fu di\'eazen;
\par - C\'e1c t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc, c\'e1 nh\'e2n s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft, nh\u7853\'3fn gia c\'f4ng, ch\u7871\'3f bi\u7871\'3fn x\'e3ng, d\u7847\'3fu di\'eazen khi xu\u7845\'3ft b\'e1n cho m\u7885\'3fi \'f0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng ho\u7863\'3f
c xu\u7845\'3ft tr\u7843\'3f h\'e0ng gia c\'f4ng, ch\u7871\'3f bi\u7871\'3fn;
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\sl-320\slmult0\widctlpar\tx1251\tx1971\tx2691\tx3411\tx4131\tx4851\tx5571\tx6291\tx7011\tx7731\tx8451\tx9171\tx9891\tx10611\tx11331\wrapdefault\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid2694944 {\rtlch\fcs1 
