\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 d. H\'e0ng th\'e1ng \'f0\u7883\'3fnh k\u7923\'3f 10 ng\'e0y 1 l\u7847\'3fn \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f t\'ednh to\'e1n v\'e0 l\u7853\'3fp t\u7901\'3f khai n\u7897\'3fp l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed
 giao th\'f4ng v\'e0o Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc (theo m\u7851\'3fu \'f0\'ednh k\'e8m Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y), c\'f5 quan thu\u7871\'3f ki\u7875\'3fm tra ra th\'f4ng b\'e1o quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp, ng\'e0
y ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng. \'d0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f nh\u7853\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\'f4ng b\'e1o ph\u7843\'3fi l\'e0m th\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc n\u7897\'3fp ti\u7873\'3fn l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng v\'e0o  Kho b
\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\'fang ng\'e0y ghi tr\'ean th\'f4ng b\'e1o.
\par L\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng n\u7897\'3fp v\'e0o Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ghi v\'e0o ch\'fd\'f5ng, lo\u7841\'3fi, kho\u7843\'3fn, h\u7841\'3fng t\'fd\'f5ng \u7913\'3fng, m\u7909\'3fc 31 c\u7911\'3fa m\u7909\'3fc l
\u7909\'3fc NSNN  v\'e0 n\u7897\'3fp to\'e0n b\u7897\'3f v\u7873\'3f Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Trung \'fd\'f5ng .
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 Trong v\'f2ng 10 ng\'e0y }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 \'f0\u7847\'3fu th\'e1ng sau \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f ph
\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 quan thu\u7871\'3f s\u7889\'3f thu, s\u7889\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp, s\u7889\'3f \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 \'e3 n}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 \u7897\'3fp l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng v\'e0 s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc tr\'edch \'f0\u7875\'3f l\u7841\'3fi s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng theo s\u7889\'3f th
\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f ph\'e1t sinh c\u7911\'3fa th\'e1ng tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc.
\par e. Ph\u7847\'3fn l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc tr\'edch \'f0\u7875\'3f l\u7841\'3fi tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc khi n\u7897\'3fp v\'e0o Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh n\'eau tr\'ean, \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f ph
\u7843\'3fi l\u7853\'3fp s\u7893\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061  s\'e1ch theo d\'f5i ri\'eang, b}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 \u7843\'3fo 
\'f0\u7843\'3fm s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\'fang m\u7909\'3fc \'f0\'edch cho vi\u7879\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn thu n\u7897\'3fp l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng. C\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f l\'e0: \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc chi cho vi\u7879\'3fc mua s
\u7893\'3f s\'e1ch, ch\u7913\'3fng t\u7915\'3f k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n, t\u7901\'3f khai, gi\u7845\'3fy b\'fat, c\'e1c ph\'fd\'f5ng ti\u7879\'3fn c\u7847\'3fn thi\u7871\'3ft ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp cho vi\u7879\'3fc thu, n\u7897
\'3fp l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng; chi b\u7891\'3fi d\'fd\u7905\'3fng cho c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f, nh\'e2n vi\'ean th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn thu l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng; th\'fd\u7903\'3fng cho nh\u7919\'3fng ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi th\u7921\'3fc hi
\u7879\'3fn t\u7889\'3ft nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f thu, n\u7897\'3fp l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng.
\par 2. L\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng thu qua gi\'e1 x\'e3ng d\u7847\'3fu l\'e0 kho\u7843\'3fn thu c\u7911\'3fa Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc , kh\'f4ng ph\u7843\'3fi l\'e0 doanh thu t\'ednh thu\u7871\'3f c\u7911\'3fa t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc nh
\u7853\'3fp kh\u7849\'3fu ch\u7871\'3f bi\u7871\'3fn x\'e3ng, d\u7847\'3fu di\'eazen khi xu\u7845\'3ft, b\'e1n v\'e0 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n nh\'fd sau:
\par - Khi t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc, c\'e1 nh\'e2n n\'eau t\u7841\'3fi \'f0i\u7875\'3fm 3, m\u7909\'3fc I c\u7911\'3fa Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y xu\u7845\'3ft, b\'e1n x\'e3ng, d\u7847\'3fu di\'eazen h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn l\u7879\'3f ph
\'ed giao th\'f4ng ph\u7843\'3fi thu v\'e0o b\'ean c\'f3 c\u7911\'3fa T\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn "Thanh to\'e1n v\u7899\'3fi Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch" (ti\u7875\'3fu kho\u7843\'3fn thanh to\'e1n kh\'e1c, chi ti\u7871\'3ft l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng), \'f0\u7889
\'3fi \u7913\'3fng v\u7899\'3fi b\'ean n\u7907\'3f c\u7911\'3fa T\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn "Thanh to\'e1n v\u7899\'3fi ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi mua"ho\u7863\'3fc T\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn "Ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7917\'3fi Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng" hay T\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn "Ti\u7873
\'3fn m\u7863\'3ft" ( n\u7871\'3fu thu tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp b\u7857\'3fng chuy\u7875\'3fn kho\u7843\'3fn hay ti\u7873\'3fn m\u7863\'3ft).
\par - H\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc kh\u7845\'3fu tr\u7915\'3f (n\u7871\'3fu c\'f3) trong tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp mua x\'e3ng, d\u7847\'3fu di\'eazen c
\u7911\'3fa t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc, c\'e1 nh\'e2n kh\'e1c trong n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0o b\'ean n\u7907\'3f c\u7911\'3fa T\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn "Thanh to\'e1n v\u7899\'3fi Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch" (ti\u7875\'3fu kho\u7843\'3fn thanh to\'e1n kh\'e1c, chi ti\u7871
\'3ft l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng), \'f0\u7889\'3fi \u7913\'3fng v\u7899\'3fi b\'ean c\'f3 c\u7911\'3fa T\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn "Ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7917\'3fi Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng" hay t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn "Ti\u7873\'3fn m\u7863\'3ft" (n\u7871\'3fu tr\u7843
\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn b\u7857\'3fng chuy\u7875\'3fn kho\u7843\'3fn hay ti\u7873\'3fn m\u7863\'3ft).
\par - H\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n s\u7889\'3f l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 \'e3 n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 
\u7897\'3fp Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 s\u7889\'3f l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc tr\'edch \'f0\u7875\'3f l\u7841\'3fi v\'e0o b\'ean n\u7907\'3f c\u7911\'3fa t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn "Thanh to\'e1n v\u7899\'3fi Ng\'e2
n s\'e1ch" (ti\u7875\'3fu kho\u7843\'3fn thanh to\'e1n kh\'e1c, chi ti\u7871\'3ft l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng) \'f0\u7889\'3fi \u7913\'3fng v\u7899\'3fi:
\par + B\'ean c\'f3 c\u7911\'3fa T\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn "Ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7917\'3fi Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng" hay "Ti\u7873\'3fn m\u7863\'3ft" s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn l\u7879\'3f l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng th\u7921\'3fc n\u7897\'3fp v\'e0o NSNN.
\par + B\'ean c\'f3 c\u7911\'3fa T\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn "Ngu\u7891\'3fn kinh ph\'ed s\u7921\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fp" (ti\u7875\'3fu kho\u7843\'3fn ngu\u7891\'3fn kinh ph\'ed s\u7921\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fp kh\'e1c, chi ti\u7871\'3ft l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng) s
\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc tr\'edch \'f0\u7875\'3f l\u7841\'3fi theo ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f.
\par - Chi ph\'ed th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f cho vi\u7879\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn thu, n\u7897\'3fp l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng k\u7871\'3ft chuy\u7875\'3fn khi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc duy\u7879\'3ft h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n ghi v\'e0o b\'ean n\u7907\'3f
 c\u7911\'3fa T\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn " Ngu\u7891\'3fn kinh ph\'ed s\u7921\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fp" (ti\u7875\'3fu kho\u7843\'3fn ngu\u7891\'3fn kinh ph\'ed s\u7921\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fp kh\'e1c, chi ti\u7871\'3ft l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng) \'f0\u7889\'3f
i \u7913\'3fng v\u7899\'3fi b\'ean c\'f3 c\u7911\'3fa T\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n chi ph\'ed ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f cho c\'f4ng t\'e1c thu, n\u7897\'3fp l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed c\'f3 li\'ean quan.
\par 3. C\'f5 quan thu\u7871\'3f qu\u7843\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af38\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f38\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 n l\'fd \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 \'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897
\'3fc \'f0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng thu, n\u7897\'3fp l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng qua gi\'e1 x\'e3ng d\u7847\'3fu c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm:
\par a. Ki\u7875\'3fm tra, \'f0\'f4n \'f0\u7889\'3fc, h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn c\'e1c t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc, c\'e1 nh\'e2n thu\u7897\'3fc \'f0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng c\'f3 nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f thu, n\u7897\'3fp l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th
\'f4ng theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 3 Ngh\u7883\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af38\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f38\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061  186/CP \'f0\'e3ng k\'fd k}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 
