\'f0\'e3ng k}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 \'fd k\'ea khai }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 \'f0\u7875\'3f ki\u7875\'3fm tra, qu\u7843\'3f}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 n l\'fd vi}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 \u7879\'3fc thu, n\u7897\'3fp l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng v\'e0o Ng
\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc theo \'f0\'fang quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh.
\par b. Th\'fd\u7901\'3fng xuy\'ean ph\u7889\'3fi h\u7907\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 quan H\u7843\'3fi quan v\'e0 c\'f5 quan ch\u7911\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft x\'e3ng, d\u7847\'3fu \u7903\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3f
a ph\'fd\'f5ng \'f0\u7875\'3f k\u7883\'3fp th\u7901\'3fi th\u7889\'3fng k\'ea n\u7855\'3fm s\u7889\'3f l\'fd\u7907\'3fng x\'e3ng, d\u7847\'3fu di\'eazen nh\u7853\'3fp kh\u7849\'3fu v\'e0 s\u7889\'3f l\'fd\u7907\'3fng x\'e3ng, d\u7847\'3fu di\'eazen s
\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft c\u7911\'3fa t\u7915\'3fng \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f cho vi\u7879\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 c theo d\'f5i, qu}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 
