\par c. Th\'fd\u7901\'3fng xuy\'ean \'f0\'f4n \'f0\u7889\'3fc c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn n\u7897\'3fp l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng v\'e0o Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\'fang k\u7923\'3f h\u7841\'3fn. \'d0\u7847
\'3fu th\'e1ng sau ph\u7843\'3fi ki\u7875\'3fm tra t\u7901\'3f khai, k\u7871\'3ft h\u7907\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi ki\u7875\'3fm tra th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f \u7903\'3f t\u7915\'3fng \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f \'f0\u7875\'3f \'f0\'f4n \'f0\u7889\'3fc n\u7897\'3fp 
\'f0\u7911\'3f s\u7889\'3f l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng ph\'e1t sinh th\'e1ng tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0o Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc. Cu\u7889\'3fi n\'e3m th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn ki\u7875\'3fm tra quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n vi\u7879\'3f
c thu n\u7897\'3fp l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng c\u7843\'3f n\'e3m c\u7911\'3fa t\u7915\'3fng \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f; ki\u7875\'3fm tra vi\u7879\'3fc tr\'edch v\'e0 qu\u7843\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 n l\'fd s}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 \u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng ph\u7847\'3fn l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc \'f0\u7875\'3f l
