\'f0i\'eazen quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi \'f0i\u7875\'3fm 3 m\u7909\'3fc I c\u7911\'3fa Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm ki\u7875\'3fm k\'ea, x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 nh r\'f5 s}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 \u7889\'3f l\'fd\u7907\'3fng x\'e3ng d\u7847\'3fu t\u7891\'3fn kho \'f0\u7871\'3fn ng\'e0y 31/12/1994, \'f0
\u7875\'3f k\'ea khai v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 quan thu\u7871\'3f v\'e0 th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn thu, n\u7897\'3fp l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng tr\'ean s\u7889\'3f x\'e3ng, d\u7847\'3fu di\'eazen xu\u7845\'3ft, b\'e1n cho c\'e1c t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3f
c, c\'e1 nh\'e2n kh\'e1c trong n\'fd\u7899\'3fc t\u7915\'3f 1/1/1995 tr\u7903\'3f \'f0i.
\par 2. C\'e1c t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc kh\'e1c kh\'f4ng thu\u7897\'3fc \'f0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng thu, n\u7897\'3fp l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng qua gi\'e1 x\'e3ng, d\u7847\'3fu \'f0i\'eazen quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi \'f0i\u7875\'3fm 3, m
\u7909\'3fc I Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y, c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o s\u7889\'3f l\'fd\u7907\'3fng x\'e3ng, d\u7847\'3fu di\'eazen t\u7891\'3fn kho th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7871\'3fn ng\'e0y 31/12/1994 chuy\u7875\'3fn sang n\'e3m 1995 \'f0\'e1nh gi\'e1 l
\u7841\'3fi gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f t\u7891\'3fn kho cho m\u7895\'3fi l\'edt x\'e3ng, m\u7895\'3fi l\'edt d\u7847\'3fu di\'eazen t\'e3ng 300 \'f0\u7891\'3fng (ba tr\'e3m \'f0\u7891\'3fng/ l\'edt) \'f0\u7875\'3f h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n t\'e3ng v\u7889\'3fn l\'fd
u \'f0\u7897\'3fng (v\u7889\'3fn thu\u7897\'3fc NSNN). Khi mua x\'e3ng, d\u7847\'3fu di\'eazen c\u7911\'3fa t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc nh\u7853\'3fp kh\u7849\'3fu, ch\u7871\'3f bi\u7871\'3fn x\'e3ng, d\u7847\'3fu ph\u7843\'3fi thanh to\'e1n ngay ti\u7873
\'3fn l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng qua gi\'e1 x\'e3ng, d\u7847\'3fu di\'eazen \'f0\u7875\'3f tr\u7843\'3f cho t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc nh\u7853\'3fp kh\u7849\'3fu, ch\u7871\'3f bi\u7871\'3fn x\'e3ng , d\u7847\'3fu.
\par 3. Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y c\'f3 hi\u7879\'3fu l\u7921\'3fc thi h\'e0nh t\u7915\'3f ng\'e0y 1/1/1995, thay th\u7871\'3f c\'e1c v\'e3n b\u7843\'3fn h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn thu ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng theo quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0
\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 211/H\'d0BT ng\'e0y 9/11/1987 c\u7911\'3fa H\u7897\'3fi \'f0\u7891\'3fng B\u7897\'3f tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng (nay l\'e0 Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f) v\'e0 c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi l\u7879\'3f ph\'ed giao th\'f4ng kh\'e1c kh\'f4ng \'f0\'fd\u7907
\'3fc Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f ho\u7863\'3fc Th\u7911\'3f t\'fd\u7899\'3fng Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f cho ph\'e9p thi h\'e0nh. Nh\u7919\'3fng quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\'e2y tr\'e1i v\u7899\'3fi Ngh\u7883\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f
 186/CP ng\'e0y 7/12/1994 \'f0\u7873\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 u b\'e3i b}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13246015\charrsid13915061 \u7887\'3f.
